  "problem": "|  | $Y=0$ | $Y=1$ | $Y=2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=0$ | $0.15$ | $0.25$ | $0.05$ |\n| $X=1$ | $0.2$ | $0.12$ | $0.23$ |\n\nCalculate $P(X+Y=1)$ given that the random variables $X$ and $Y$ have the joint probability mass function $f(x,y)$ shown in the table above.",
